{"title":"Tome Tailoring Emberweave","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Thak Veteran, Thak Spearman</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-veteran\" title=\"Thak Veteran - dropped it in 1 of 15 looted corpses (1/15)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ff071ed391eae276969c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Veteran</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-spearman\" title=\"Thak Spearman - dropped it in 1 of 526 looted corpses (1/526)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Spearman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/526<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"tome-tailoring-emberweave\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/8fee9eb0ad07484d4dd3.svg\" alt=\"Tome Tailoring Emberweave\"></div><h3>Tome Tailoring Emberweave</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>11/8/2026, 4:13:01 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}